#: ../../contribute/validation.md:1 854535926a2f497bbccb39150d71ebf7
msgid "✅ Validation"
msgstr "✅ 验证"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:3 8ba9a86f391e4fbdb9c644f6e7cd606d
msgid ""
"A contribution is more than code. The `check` command checks that a "
"module follows the project rules:"
msgstr "贡献不只是代码。`check` 命令会检查模块是否遵循项目的规则："

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:13 d4270e174fcb45b7acf9582614d983cb
msgid ""
"The command shows each issue with its file and line. Most messages tell "
"you how to fix the issue. The command also runs on every pull request, "
"with the [tests](project:testing.md)."
msgstr "该命令会显示每个问题及其文件和行号。大多数消息会告诉你如何修复问题。它还会与[测试](project:testing.md)一起在每个拉取请求上运行。"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:17 aceeebe3c2204768b2fb67a84be469b4
msgid "What the command checks"
msgstr "该命令检查的内容"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:20 700f61b81df94227a1b9d7dd789b75c2
msgid "**Metadata**"
msgstr "**元数据**"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:21 664a5081b73c49ebbfd8e2c69d1d712e
msgid ""
"The `module.bs` file is valid. If it has errors, the command shows only "
"these errors. See the [metadata page](project:metadata.md)"
msgstr "`module.bs` 文件有效。如果文件有错误，该命令只显示这些错误。参见[元数据页面](project:metadata.md)"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:22 3fa12c9b10384041bb908849e62abc86
msgid "**Layout**"
msgstr "**文件布局**"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:23 3f6c492ece0f447aa515a858f4804ef3
msgid ""
"The module has its required files. Each function starts with the [license"
" header](#contribute-license-header). Each file is a declared feature or "
"a [private file](#contribute-public-and-private-files)"
msgstr ""
"模块包含必需的文件。每个函数都以[许可证头](#contribute-license-"
"header)开头。每个文件要么是已声明的特性，要么是[私有文件](#contribute-public-and-private-files)"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:24 9edfff0a4beb443287b2c509541f44e6
msgid "**References**"
msgstr "**引用**"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:25 78a213c7120a497d8ce16d1a366816a1
msgid ""
"Each Bookshelf ID in a file belongs to a known feature. No feature uses "
"the private files of another feature"
msgstr "文件中的每个 Bookshelf ID 都属于一个已知的特性。任何特性都不使用其他特性的私有文件"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:26 09375d8fcebd4f31ae8dea41ee06e6a3
msgid "**Changelog**"
msgstr "**更新日志**"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:27 63c9c99646ca444294736631f4bfb041
msgid ""
"The [changelog](project:changelog.md) has an `Unreleased` section. It has"
" a line for each change since the last release"
msgstr "[更新日志](project:changelog.md)包含 `Unreleased` 章节。自上次发布以来的每项更改都有一行记录"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:28 e318b6215f2c4515a083115949e04fc6
msgid "**Documentation**"
msgstr "**文档**"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:29 3b37ca433798469797f988ab2799cdb2
msgid ""
"The module has a documentation page. Each feature has its [feature "
"directive](#contribute-feature-directive)"
msgstr "模块有文档页面。每个特性都有对应的[特性指令](#contribute-feature-directive)"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:34 4c08d46bbabb45cabc2ac6d60dde4289
msgid "Messages that need more detail"
msgstr "需要进一步说明的消息"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:19 752153135b4c469ca746e52271371cc9
msgid "Message"
msgstr "消息"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:19 03d118935ee04acaa0a27fc2ce48eefa
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "修复方法"

