msgstr "'x' cannot be attributed: the feature part is dynamic"

#: ../../contribute/validation.md:19 d57ccccbf25e4426a93702cbc8a1bd93
msgid "A macro builds the ID. Write enough of the ID to identify the feature"
msgstr "该 ID 由宏构建。请写出足够的部分以确定特性"

